        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Global TC4340-61, Blade Stop Spacer</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a blade stop spacer for the <a href=\"/products/lcn-4040-series-replacement-ada-compliant-heavy-duty-door-closer-global-tc4300\"><b>Global TC4300 Series Door Closer</b></a> and the <a href=\"/products/ada-compliant-heavy-duty-door-closer-global-tc4361\"><b>Global TC4361 Series Door Closer</b></a>. This door closer spacer is used when the door frame has a blade stop and parallel bracket must be mounted on the frame rabbet. It is used to lower the parallel arm shoe to clear 1/2\" blade stop. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the TC4340-61 Door Closer Blade Stop Spacer:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-3/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Heavy Duty Black Plastic</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
